#: templates/metra_bookkeeping/index.html:39
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The financial year %(year)s has ended. Make the year-end entries and close "
"it; the financial statements are due by %(due)s."
msgstr ""
"Räkenskapsperioden %(year)s har tagit slut. Gör bokslutsdispositionerna och "
"stäng den; bokslutet ska vara klart senast %(due)s."

#: templates/metra_bookkeeping/index.html:40
